        "text": "During oral argument the petitioner emphasized the FCRA\u2019s remedial scheme, the government\u2019s status as a major credit\u2011card issuer, and the 1996 amendment\u2019s intent, while Justice Sotomayor questioned whether the specific provisions of the FCRA should govern the general ones."
      }
